# Web IDL: Web IDL Standard (WHATWG); requirements/languages/webidl.md
name     webidl idl
keyword  interface partial dictionary enum typedef callback namespace mixin includes attribute readonly
keyword  static getter setter deleter stringifier inherit optional required const maplike setlike
keyword  iterable async constructor
type     any boolean byte octet short long unsigned float double bigint DOMString ByteString USVString
type     object undefined sequence record Promise FrozenArray
builtin  true false null Infinity NaN
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "
operators  =:;,?<>()[]{}.
upper-type
